# TC002 - Add Same Product Multiple Times to Cart



## Test Scenario
Add the same product multiple times to the shopping cart.



## Objective
Validate that the system correctly updates the quantity when the same product is added multiple times and ensures the cart displays accurate product information (name, price, and total quantity).



## Preconditions
1. User is on the Products page.
2. A product is available for selection.

URL: https://automationexercise.com/products


## Test Steps
1. Navigate to the Products page  
2. Select a product from the list  
3. Click on "ADD TO CART"  
4. Click on "Continue Shopping"  
5. Click on "ADD TO CART" again for the same product  
6. Click on "Continue Shopping"  
7. Repeat the "ADD TO CART" action multiple times  
8. Click on "View Cart"  
9. Verify the quantity of the selected product in the cart  



## Expected Result
The system should correctly update the quantity of the same product in the cart each time it is added, maintaining accurate:
- Product name  
- Product price  
- Total quantity  



## Actual Result
The system correctly updated the product quantity in the cart each time the same product was added. The cart displayed the correct product name, price, and total quantity as expected.



